	('62ab50df-e71a-4356-8bb1-a12537edd0c4', 'Executive and Personal Assistants', 'CORP008', 'This corporate training program on Executive and Personal Assistants helps participants understand key principles, explore practical workplace examples, and build confidence applying executive and personal assistants in their daily roles.', 'data:image/jpeg;base64,', 'Active', '4 weeks', 0, 0, 0, 3, 3, 'de3175cc-13f8-4cba-986a-363a3057a90d', '2025-12-04 00:00:00+00', '2026-05-26 10:32:14.340428+00', NULL, '["Explain the core concepts and importance of Executive and Personal Assistants in a professional environment.", "Recognize common workplace situations where strong executive and personal assistants is critical to success.", "Apply tools, techniques, and best practices related to executive and personal assistants in realistic scenarios.", "Create a personal action plan to strengthen your day-to-day performance in executive and personal assistants.", "Demonstrate growth in key skills developed in this course: Executive and Personal Assistants, Professionalism, Problem Solving."]', NULL, NULL, 'Corporate Training', 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'soft', NULL, '[-0.02525221,0.015037425,0.08040963,0.002379512,-0.011450739,0.0010632828,0.003501866,0.061555292,0.047257014,0.03669083,0.047814406,-0.06281548,0.024803875,-0.05932573,-0.010778234,0.009748274,0.0104631875,0.008233626,0.024355538,0.028208803,0.007803466,0.042434376,-0.0034836903,0.04367033,-0.0043258346,-0.013013855,-0.008578965,0.049074594,-0.0066644507,0.010214786,0.04393691,-0.015170714,-0.03424316,0.010366251,0.059907354,0.016976174,-0.0022856037,0.04168311,0.026997084,0.030462598,0.018309064,0.03203783,0.01867258,0.04594836,0.015691752,-0.009415052,0.02391932,0.02491293,0.023010531,0.043137174,0.0066583925,0.06320323,0.016249143,0.029105475,-0.028281506,0.0035291295,-0.00907577,-0.039502017,-0.016576307,0.008203333,0.037829846,-0.03036566,-0.013135027,0.10905465,0.016067386,-0.009833095,-0.02400414,0.0089